ted then our second idea would  never have happened we'd still be at  square one so to conclude I wish you  three things firstly that you create  wealth and fulfillment for yourself and  that you employ you create employment  and job satisfaction for others that you  don't wait a minute longer than you  absolutely have to that you have a real  sense of urgency to do this and that  finally if you end up in hospital the  nurses are as nice to you as they were  to me thank you and good luck  you

